# Personnel reverse accordion example, completed 2026-10-22.
# Base: main at 6cf26319ab2f8b89706677ccfacd83fddb2de46b.
# This patch preserves the finished component, styles, tooltip copy, and tests.
# Funding entries are visible by default under a single shared header row.
# Job Details expands below each employee on bg-base-200 without header borders.
# Job description, FTE, dates, and monetary columns align with funding columns.
# Job Details and its first column use pl-8 to align with the employee name.
# FE Start / FE End use the shared Funding Entry From UC Path tooltips.
# The footer sums current, known funding distributions for filtered employees.
# Restore selectively against later work; the active original table already
# retains the FE header labels and tooltips, so do not blindly apply over edits.

